A||||1||Pretender||Power Pully install!
Z||000000||Pretender||04-07-99||09:11 PM||||Well i finally put my power pully on tonight, it went well, i also decided that i didn't need the air cond. so i just unhooked the belt...things were going fine untill i got to the pully puller...mine didn't fit, so i went to napa and bought the flat type puller.it didn't fit either, so in a mad streak i just tugged on the pully and it came off!...i couldn't believe it!...from that point it was very easy...i can tell a difference in power from second gear and above..if any one would like instructions i would be happy mail them to you, just drop me a line....thanks.<br>
Z||000001||PaUL||04-07-99||09:14 PM||||you dont need a puller to pull any of the pulleys, you need a puller to take off the harmonic balancer that the main pulley is bolted onto.
